// R1 — Destructive command blocked by the Kage risk gate
//
// MITRE ATT&CK: Impact (TA0040) / T1485 Data Destruction
// Related control: risk_hook.py NEVER_CMD_PATTERNS + HIGH_CMD_PATTERNS
//
// Fires when the PreToolUse hook denied a command that would have destroyed data:
// deletion inside the home directory, deletion of source files, file truncation.
//
// NOTE: `reason` values are emitted in Romanian by risk_hook.py. The filter matches
// the data as stored — translating these strings breaks the rule.
//
// Observed baseline (480 events / 20 days): 5 matches.
KageRisk_CL
| where decision == "deny"
| where reason contains "rm în home" or reason contains "ștergere fișiere sursă"
     or reason contains "truncate fișier" or reason contains "ștergere foldere"
| project TimeGenerated, ts, tool, risk_level, reason
